notes: |
  A stochastic-volatility path simulator: a three-half-life EWMA of realized minute variance,
  reverting toward a blend of the asset's 7-day level and a committed long-run level, modulated
  by a two-sided power of a time-of-week profile, driven by Student-t(4) innovations. No drift,
  no cross-asset structure. Entry point agent/modeling.py:simulate; artifacts
  agent/artifacts/tow_full.npz and vlong_full.npz (215 kB, committed). Runs offline.

  Backtested with agent/predict.py (official synth_lib.backtester), 1000 paths -- the count the
  validator serves -- on 7 days of prompts ending 2026-09-13 (2026-09-12 for the 1-hour leg,
  which otherwise runs past the edge of the snapshot). "Starting point" is the log-normal
  martingale this repo ships with, scored on identical prompt sets.

